  "setup": "Independent CPU training of small MLP flow-matching nets on FOUR real datasets (california 8-d, diabetes 10-d, digits 64-d, olivetti-faces 256-d [block-avg downsampled from 4096-d raw pixels]); IDENTICAL net/optimizer/steps/data within a dataset. FM = flow from an uninformed N(0,I) prior (unanchored linear interpolation, the paper's FM). DB = flow from a DATA-ANCHORED Gaussian reference N(mu_hat,Sigma_hat) with shrinkage (the paper's data-size-robust reference drift; robust O(n^-1/2) moment estimates). 5 seeds per (dataset,size) with t-distribution 95% CIs. Quality vs held-out real test: sliced-W1, RBF-MMD, detection-AUC. Degradation-RATE = per-seed log-log slope of W1 vs training size, fit independently per seed; FM-vs-DB slope difference tested with paired 95% CI and one-sided Wilcoxon signed-rank across 4 datasets x 5 seeds = 20 pairs."
